n (1.1% of sales), so the asset base is being harvested rather than grown.","Its Rule of 40 score is 33, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business."],"own":["Insiders own a modest 1.1%, and institutions hold 100%.","Insiders have only bought over the past year (1 purchase, net $498K bought).","Shareholder yield is a modest 0.7% (1.1% in dividends).","The share count has grown 0.7% a year over five years, diluting existing holders.","It has paid a dividend for 10 consecutive years, raising it 2.5% a year over the last five."],"people":["With about 985 employees, each generates about $2.5M of revenue, 6.9x the Industrials median, and productivity has risen 33.8% a year.","Free cash flow is negative, at -$344K per employee.","CEO pay is $3.3M (1x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (1/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $22K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"INSUFFICIENT DATA","conv":null,"head":"Not enough data to value it: missing price or fair value.","pros":[],"cons":[],"flags":[],"need":[],"buy_below":null,"vc":null,"med":{"pe":23.2692,"ev_ebitda":13.319,"pfcf":22.2778,"pb":3.0551,"roic":0.1001,"gross_margin":0.2851,"fcf_margin":0.068,"div_yield":0.0147}},"ticker":"FTAI","date":"2026-11-06"}